not relicense it. Preserve the notices below when redistributing a build.

Its runtime dependencies are resolved from the npm registry and recorded in
package-lock.json rather than vendored here. This checkout resolved
@alicloud/openapi-core 1.0.9 (ISC), @alicloud/gateway-pop 0.0.8 (ISC),
